ull food menu and plenty of seats.","wifi":"Reliable Wi-Fi","hours":"","url":"https://loftycoffee.com/pages/little-italy-cafe-and-bakery","phone":"","source":"https://sandispots.com/best-of-san-diego/coffee-shops-to-work","sourceName":"Sandi Spots","kind":"work"},{"id":"sd8","region":"San Diego","area":"La Jolla (Bird Rock)","name":"Bird Rock Coffee Roasters – Bird Rock","type":"Coffee shop","setting":"Indoor","address":"5627 La Jolla Blvd, La Jolla, CA 92037","lat":32.814509,"lng":-117.269884,"vibe":"Widely considered the city's best roaster. Tables are limited, so treat it as a two-hour focused session.","wifi":"","hours":"","url":"https://www.birdrockcoffee.com/pages/cafes","phone":"619-272-0203","source":"https://sandispots.com/best-of-san-diego/coffee-shops-to-work","sourceName":"Sandi Spots","kind":"work"},{"id":"sd9","region":"San Diego","area":"North Park","name":"Coffee & Tea Collective","type":"Coffee shop","setting":"Indoor","address":"2911 El Cajon Blvd, San Diego, CA 92104","lat":32.75526,"lng":-117.131222,"vibe":"A local remote worker says it's usually pretty quiet, which is perfect when you need to focus. Known for matcha and seasonal drinks.","wifi":"","hours":"","url":"https://www.coffeeandteacollective.com/pages/contact-us","phone":"(619) 564-8086","source":"https://dosd.com/p/5-great-coffee-shops-for-working-remotely-san-diego-loacls-list","sourceName":"DoSD","kind":"work"},{"id":"sd10","region":"San Diego","area":"North Park","name":"Moniker General Outpost","type":"Coffee shop","setting":"Indoor","address":"3140 University Ave, San Diego, CA 92104","lat":32.748526,"lng":-117.126664,"vibe":"A local's favorite place to work: kind baristas and outlets throughout, so you're not fighting for a plug.","wifi":"Outlets throughout","hours":"","url":"https://www.monikercoffee.com/visit","phone":"","source":"https://dosd.com/p/5-great-coffee-shops-for-working-remotely-san-diego-loacls-list","sourceName":"DoSD","kind":"work"},{"id":"sd11","region":"San Diego","area":"Old Town","name":"Garden Coffee","type":"Café","setting":"Garden patio + indoor","address":"2611 Congress St, San Diego, CA 92110","lat":32.752577,"lng":-117.196698,"vibe":"Peaceful, with a fresh outdoor feel but tucked away enough that you don't deal with traffic or noise.","wifi":"","hours":"","url":"https://joe.coffee/locations/ca/san-diego/garden-coffee-san-diego/","phone":"(619) 500-8004","source":"https://dosd.com/p/5-great-coffee-shops-for-working-remotely-san-diego-loacls-list","sourceName":"DoSD","kind":"work"},{"id":"sd12","region":"San Diego","area":"La Mesa","name":"Brew Coffee Spot","type":"Coffee shop","setting":"Indoor","address":"6101 Lake Murray Blvd, La Mesa, CA 91942","lat":32.789704,"lng":-117.021513,"vibe":"Prints a two-hour Wi-Fi code on your receipt, a built-in deadline for one focused morning block. Easy parking.","wifi":"Wi-Fi code on receipt lasts 2 hours","hours":"Mon–Fri 7:30 AM–3 PM; Sat 7:30 AM–5 PM; Sun 7:30 AM–3 PM","url":"https://www.brewcoffeespot.com/","phone":"(619) 713-6698","source":"https://www.thesandiegolist.com/eat-drink/coffee-shops-to-work-from","sourceName":"The San Diego List","kind":"work"}],"pods":[{"id":"sdp1","region":"San Diego","area":"Valencia Park","name":"Recording Studio – Legler Benbough Teen IDEA Lab (Valencia Park/Malcolm X Library)","cost":"Free","rate":"Free; no library card needed","address":"5148 Market St, San Diego, CA 92114","lat":32.710488,"lng":-117.084074,"hours":"Mon–Tue 2–8 PM & Wed–Fri 2–6 PM teens 12–18; Sat 2–6 PM all ages","book":"Adults 18+ call to book weekday time; Saturday open hours are all ages.","contact":"619-527-3431","url":"https://www.sandiego.gov/public-library/idea/mx","note":"Recording studio for voice, music or podcasts: iMac with Logic Pro X, Pro Tools, GarageBand and a MIDI keyboard. Teen-focused lab.","kind":"pod"},{"id":"sdp2","region":"San Diego","area":"City Heights","name":"City Heights Library IDEA Lab","cost":"Free","rate":"Free","address":"3795 Fairmount Av